  "body": "I recently made a [change](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1720703) to Firefox to follow https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hidden-elements to the letter by making `source` / `track` `display: none` by default.\r\n\r\nHowever, it seems like at least `source` might not be web-compatible. Or, at least [one page](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1721370) relies on those elements having a box for lazy-loading purposes...\r\n\r\nThis page seems to use a custom lazy-loader (not any popular library I could find at least), so I plan to try reaching out to the site first to see if they can fix it on their side, but otherwise (or if I find more similar regressions) I'll probably be forced to revert the change.\r\n\r\ncc @annevk ",
